   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2023-03-01",
   "text": "Thirty-Two Hour Workweek Act\n This bill shortens the standard workweek under federal law from 40 hours to 32 hours over a three-year phase in period. It also requires specified overtime pay for workdays longer than eight hours."
